OL,3,ASpain battles climate change on several
OL,4,Afronts
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a small green meadow in the Gredos
OL,7,Fmountains, west of Madrid, a couple of
OL,8,Fdozen cows belonging to Juan Angel
OL,9,FIzquierdo and his family are grazing.
OL,10,FThe only noise is the gentle clang of
OL,11,Fthe bells around the animals' necks.
OL,13,FThis would be an idyllic scene were it
OL,14,Fnot for the blackened pine and oak
OL,15,Ftrees all around, the legacy of a
OL,16,Fdevastating recent wildfire.
OL,18,F"It was immense, I've never seen
OL,19,Fanything like it," says Izquierdo,
OL,20,Fwhose family have been farming here for
OL,21,F200 years.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
