OL,3,ASpain battles climate change on several
OL,4,Afronts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire, in late July, merged with two
OL,7,Fothers, burning a total of around
OL,8,F80,000 hectares (200,000 acres), making
OL,9,Fit the biggest blaze Spain has ever
OL,10,Fregistered.
